{"agent":"fx-lockwait-log","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"A run that recorded a positive sub-second wait is silently dropped from gate status. `_queued_notes` uses `w >= 1`, so given evidence `waited_s=0.5` and `elapsed_s=10.0`, the function returns no `queued` note even though the run “waited at all” (the docstring’s own criterion) and the change’s intent is to show wait in gate status. `runner._waited` can produce such values, e.g. `p.waited_s = 0.5`, so this is reachable, not synthetic. The status line should be emitted for any positive recorded wait, or the threshold should be justified in the code.","digest":"9b49cfa82ba24e16","location":"ddflow/services/gates/outcomes.py:286","severity":"LOW","title":"ddflow/services/gates/outcomes.py:286"}],"chunks_total":4,"coverage":"4/4 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":16992,"diff_sha":"3a7b8ce15c05b9a6d881cb69fd3b932724a8bd5ce5f4eb6db5e859d037a9af57","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":492.7,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"44662c38f1fea66b","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B1d51fb9da1.rubber_duck.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261022T195221Z-40492f29.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4],"reviewed_head":"3fb785122d5306489f61bbc0964125e4e8cfe42d","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/gates.py":"100644 cd85deb540617af132d1b34eec4f4bb6dbe12d0d","ddflow/services/ci.py":"100644 9ed48150aa8d2132a489c06dbf454e5c08ef212d","ddflow/services/ci_marker.py":"100644 89c59b8042e157e5daaab123e508c2ba35cb876f","ddflow/services/gates/outcomes.py":"100644 4f656fd4f37022f35e4cf4962b206ff8828831c1","ddflow/services/gates/runner.py":"100644 d469212cb588c37d8299b9d6a6b0f92d01f59efe","ddflow/services/metrics/facts.py":"100644 5e551e5